scored: 0

card c03
kind: teach
type: reveal
scored: 0
title: About half have changed
predicts: c01
figure: half-life-grid
figure_at: 1

body:
    After one half-life, about half of the nuclei have decayed. The rest were not cut in half. The time it takes for a group to fall to about half is its [[half-life]].

