card c12
kind: teach
type: explain
scored: 0
title: Some fade fast, some very slowly
figure: half-life-ladder
caption: The bars are not to scale: each step is far bigger than it looks.
figure_at: 2

body:
    Half-lives are very different. Some are a fraction of a second. Others are billions of years. So some radioactive materials fade quickly and others take a very long time. You do not need to memorise these.

